1755067935\" width=416 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176780/extras/f1d50b26f98f84c1fb2166c6a77e79a7.webm?t=1755067935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176780/extras/f1d50b26f98f84c1fb2166c6a77e79a7.mp4?t=1755067935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of Hope Town and its dark history, immersing yourself in the atmosphere and setting of the game. Become part of this captivating journey and uncover what lies in the shadows of the abandoned prison.</p>",
